---
layout: null
permalink: /p/abstracts.json
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
The abstracts of the publications page, keyed by the id of each abstract box. The page itself
leaves them out (a third of its size) and fetches this file the first time someone opens an
abstract or searches.
{%- endcomment -%}
{
{%- assign first = true -%}
{%- for publi in site.publications -%}
{%- if publi.abstract and publi.image -%}
{%- unless first -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- assign first = false %}
{{ publi.image | remove: '.jpg' | jsonify }}: {{ publi.abstract | strip | jsonify }}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
}
